    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You are the Undead</h2>Collect human essence to summon more undead. Slay the greedy humans and challenge their leaders in Turn-based tactical fights. You are the final boss.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/029928fcf33462c7c847a5ac4a3cc503.poster.avif?t=1733428922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/029928fcf33462c7c847a5ac4a3cc503.webm?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/029928fcf33462c7c847a5ac4a3cc503.mp4?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nemire</h2>Nemire is a daunting union of humanity's mightiest defenders. A symphony of unparalleled skill and cooperation. And they are everything that is wrong with the living. You must raise Undead and destroy greed and power-driven Humans.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/544fa5527424a2d4a93639cada2dd0e0.avif?t=1733428922\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Turn-based tactical combat<br></li><li>Build your squad of ever-evolving undead<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/631a62c8ffb28610cad80381ef3f5b6d.poster.avif?t=1733428922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/631a62c8ffb28610cad80381ef3f5b6d.webm?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/631a62c8ffb28610cad80381ef3f5b6d.mp4?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>Random unit traits modify how abilities and standard attacks work<br></li><li>Meaningful unit progression<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/a89a493c195b524841bd36855d86a0c9.poster.avif?t=1733428922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/a89a493c195b524841bd36855d86a0c9.webm?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/a89a493c195b524841bd36855d86a0c9.mp4?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>Combination of handcrafted and procedurally generated environments<br></li><li>Gradually ramping difficulty<br></li><li> Impactful abilities</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/617fc7c91d30d54efca0c61336b87c12.poster.avif?t=1733428922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/617fc7c91d30d54efca0c61336b87c12.webm?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/617fc7c91d30d54efca0c61336b87c12.mp4?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You are the Undead</h2>Collect human essence to summon more undead. Slay the greedy humans and challenge their leaders in Turn-based tactical fights. You are the final boss.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/029928fcf33462c7c847a5ac4a3cc503.poster.avif?t=1733428922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/029928fcf33462c7c847a5ac4a3cc503.webm?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/029928fcf33462c7c847a5ac4a3cc503.mp4?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Nemire</h2>Nemire is a daunting union of humanity's mightiest defenders. A symphony of unparalleled skill and cooperation. And they are everything that is wrong with the living. You must raise Undead and destroy greed and power-driven Humans.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/544fa5527424a2d4a93639cada2dd0e0.avif?t=1733428922\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Turn-based tactical combat<br></li><li>Build your squad of ever-evolving undead<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/631a62c8ffb28610cad80381ef3f5b6d.poster.avif?t=1733428922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/631a62c8ffb28610cad80381ef3f5b6d.webm?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/631a62c8ffb28610cad80381ef3f5b6d.mp4?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>Random unit traits modify how abilities and standard attacks work<br></li><li>Meaningful unit progression<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/a89a493c195b524841bd36855d86a0c9.poster.avif?t=1733428922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/a89a493c195b524841bd36855d86a0c9.webm?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/a89a493c195b524841bd36855d86a0c9.mp4?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br></li><li>Combination of handcrafted and procedurally generated environments<br></li><li>Gradually ramping difficulty<br></li><li> Impactful abilities</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/617fc7c91d30d54efca0c61336b87c12.poster.avif?t=1733428922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/617fc7c91d30d54efca0c61336b87c12.webm?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1955120/extras/617fc7c91d30d54efca0c61336b87c12.mp4?t=1733428922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
